  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Creates a new binary <a href=\"MongoVector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoVector</code></a> using the given <code>data</code>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <code>data</code> 创建一个新的二进制 <a href=\"MongoVector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoVector</code></a>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "NOTE: The float array is not copied; changes to the provided array will be referenced in the created\n<code>MongoVector</code> instance.",
      "translation": "注意：浮点数组不会被复制；对提供的数组所做的更改将反映在创建的 <code>MongoVector</code> 实例中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new binary <a href=\"MongoVector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoVector</code></a> from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Vector.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Vector</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Vector.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Vector</code></a>创建一个新的二进制<a href=\"MongoVector.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 中的类\"><code>MongoVector</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new binary <a href=\"MongoVector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoVector</code></a> using the given <code>BinaryVector</code>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <code>BinaryVector</code> 创建一个新的二进制对象 <a href=\"MongoVector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoVector</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">UnsupportedOperationException</a></code> - if the underlying data type is <code>int1</code> <code>PackedBitBinaryVector</code>.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">UnsupportedOperationException</a></code> - 如果底层数据类型为 <code>int1</code> <code>PackedBitBinaryVector</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>BinaryVector.DataType.FLOAT32</code> vector is a vector of floating-point numbers, where each element in the\nvector is a <code>float</code>. The given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Vector.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Vector</code></a> must be able to return a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Vector.html#toFloatArray()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>float</code></a>\narray.",
      "translation": "<code>BinaryVector.DataType.FLOAT32</code> 向量是由浮点数构成的向量，其中向量的每个元素均为 <code>float</code>。给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Vector.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Vector</code></a> 必须能够返回一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Vector.html#toFloatArray()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>float</code></a> 数组。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>BinaryVector.DataType.INT8</code> vector is a vector of 8-bit signed integers where each byte in the vector\nrepresents an element of a vector, with values in the range <code>[-128, 127]</code>.",
      "translation": "`BinaryVector.DataType.INT8` 向量是由 8 位有符号整数组成的向量，其中向量的每个字节代表一个元素，其取值范围为 `[-128, 127]`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>BinaryVector.DataType.FLOAT32</code> vector is a vector of floating-point numbers, where each element in the\nvector is a <code>float</code>.",
      "translation": "`BinaryVector.DataType.FLOAT32` 向量是一个浮点数向量，其中向量的每个元素都是一个 `float`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "NOTE: The byte array is not copied; changes to the provided array will be referenced in the created\n<code>MongoVector</code> instance.",
      "translation": "注意：字节数组不会被复制；对提供的数组所做的更改将反映在创建的 <code>MongoVector</code> 实例中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "MongoDB-specific extension to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Vector.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Vector</code></a> based on Mongo's <code>BinaryVector</code>. Note that only <code>float32</code>\nand <code>int8</code> variants can be represented as floating-point numbers. <code>int1</code> throws\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a> when calling <a href=\"#toFloatArray()\"><code>toFloatArray()</code></a> and <a href=\"#toDoubleArray()\"><code>toDoubleArray()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "基于 MongoDB 的 `BinaryVector` 对 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Vector.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Vector</code></a>` 的特定扩展。注意，仅 <code>float32</code> 和 <code>int8</code> 变体可以表示为浮点数。<code>int1</code> 在调用 <a href=\"#toFloatArray()\"><code>toFloatArray()</code></a> 和 <a href=\"#toDoubleArray()\"><code>toDoubleArray()</code></a> 时会抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a href=\"MongoVector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoVector</code></a> using vector values from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Vector.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Vector</code></a> to be represented as binary\n        float32.",
      "translation": "使用来自给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Vector.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Vector</code></a> 的向量值，将其表示为二进制 float32 格式的 <a href=\"MongoVector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoVector</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
